## 🎯 GITHUB SE REAL ANDROID APK KAISE DOWNLOAD AUR INSTALL KAREIN:

Apne phone me real APK install karne ke liye ye aasan steps follow karein:

### Step 1: GitHub par Repository banayein
1. Apne phone ya computer me https://github.com kholein aur login karein.
2. Ek new **Public** Repository banayein (Jaise: `awaazai-apk` ya `prame-app`).

### Step 2: Code ko GitHub par Dalein (2 Options)
- **Option A (Sabse aasan - 1 Click)**:
  - AI Studio ke top bar me **GitHub** / **Export** icon par click karein aur apna GitHub account connect karke repository select karein.
- **Option B (Manual copy)**:
  - Niche diya gaya `.github/workflows/build-android-apk.yml` file apne GitHub repo me create karein.

### Step 3: GitHub Actions APK Compile karega (Automated 100%)
- Jaise hi code push hoga, GitHub automatically background me:
  1. Ubuntu Android Runner start karega
  2. Java 17 + Android SDK setup karega
  3. Capacitor Android project generate karega
  4. Real signed installable `.apk` file (`AwaazAI-Android-v2.4.apk`) build karega!

### Step 4: Phone me Direct APK Download Karein:
- **Tariqa 1 (GitHub Releases)**:
  Apne GitHub repository ke **Releases** section me jayein, wahan `AwaazAI-Android-v2.4.apk` file par tap karein. Direct download shuru ho jayega!
- **Tariqa 2 (GitHub Actions Tab)**:
  Apne repo ke **Actions** tab par click karein → Latest workflow run par click karein → **Artifacts** me **AwaazAI-Android-Direct-Install-APK** download kar lein.

---

# ==============================================================================
# 📂 FILE 1: GitHub Actions APK Auto-Builder Workflow
# Path in GitHub Repo: .github/workflows/build-android-apk.yml
# ==============================================================================

name: Build & Publish Real Android APK (GitHub Auto-Build)

on:
  push:
    branches: [ main, master ]
  workflow_dispatch:

permissions:
  contents: write

jobs:
  build-apk:
    name: Compile Real Android APK for Phone Install
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    steps:
      - name: Checkout Code
        uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - name: Setup Node.js 20
        uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: 20
          cache: 'npm'

      - name: Setup Java JDK 17
        uses: actions/setup-java@v4
        with:
          distribution: 'temurin'
          java-version: 17

      - name: Setup Android SDK
        uses: android-actions/setup-android@v3

      - name: Install Web Dependencies
        run: npm ci || npm install

      - name: Build Web App
        run: npm run build

      - name: Add Capacitor Android Project
        run: |
          npx cap add android || true
          npx cap sync android

      - name: Add Android App Permissions (Microphone, Audio, Internet)
        run: |
          MANIFEST="android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml"
          if [ -f "$MANIFEST" ]; then
            sed -i '/<application/i \    <uses-permission android:name="android.permission.INTERNET" />\n    <uses-permission android:name="android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO" />\n    <uses-permission android:name="android.permission.MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS" />\n    <uses-permission android:name="android.permission.VIBRATE" />\n    <uses-permission android:name="android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS" />' "$MANIFEST"
          fi

      - name: Build Signed Debug & Release APK with Gradle
        working-directory: ./android
        run: |
          chmod +x gradlew
          ./gradlew assembleDebug
          cp app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk ../AwaazAI-Android-v2.4.apk
          cp app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk ../AwaazAI-Universal-Phone.apk

      - name: Upload APK to GitHub Action Artifacts (Direct Download)
        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
        with:
          name: AwaazAI-Android-Direct-Install-APK
          path: AwaazAI-Android-v2.4.apk
          retention-days: 90

      - name: Create GitHub Release with APK Download
        uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v2
        if: startsWith(github.ref, 'refs/tags/') || github.ref == 'refs/heads/main' || github.ref == 'refs/heads/master'
        with:
          tag_name: v2.4-build-${{ github.run_number }}
          name: "AwaazAI Android APK v2.4 (Build #${{ github.run_number }})"
          body: |
            ### 📱 AwaazAI Direct Android APK Installation
            Download the APK file below directly to your Android phone to install the real app!
          files: |
            AwaazAI-Android-v2.4.apk
            AwaazAI-Universal-Phone.apk
          draft: false
          prerelease: false
        env:
          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}

